ValueSet: InterweaveSocialCareSupportNeedCategory
Id: Interweave-InterweaveSocialCareSupportNeedCategory
Description: "Defines the set of codes that can be used to identify the category of support need. The current defination for the need only caters for the needs defined as part of the 'The Care and Support (Eligibility Criteria) Regulations 2015'. "
* ^name = "Interweave Social Care Support Need Category"

* include codes from system Interweave-SocialCareSupportNeedCategory


CodeSystem: InterweaveSocialCareSupportNeedCategory
Id: Interweave-SocialCareSupportNeedCategory
Description: "The categorisation of the social care support need as defined within The Care and Support (Eligibility Criteria) Regulations 2015."
* ^name = "InterweaveSocialCareSupportNeedCategory"
* ^content = #complete
* ^caseSensitive = true

* #Adult "Adult's Need"
* #Carer "Carer's Need"